Zaoyu HarmonyOS suite / 造隅鸿蒙工作区

Vecrune incorporates VectorCraft through pinned Cargo Git dependencies from
https://github.com/harmony-contrib/vectorcraft
branch feat-openharmony. The exact revision is recorded in Cargo.toml and Cargo.lock.
The source engine, UI, native host and their original contributors retain
their original copyrights, under MIT OR Apache-2.0. License texts and third-party
notices are retained in licenses/vectorcraft; the pinned repository contains
the full asset inventory and contributor records.

The migrated Rust host originates in apps/vectorcraft/src/ohos,
apps/vectorcraft/src/logging.rs, control_server.rs and control_deadlines.rs;
the Ability registration originates in apps/vectorcraft-ohos.

The suite also incorporates these independently pinned Cargo Git dependencies:

Pixrune:  https://github.com/harmony-contrib/photocraft
Cliprune: https://github.com/harmony-contrib/filmcraft
Lutrune:  https://github.com/harmony-contrib/lightcraft
