Gridrune: https://github.com/harmony-contrib/gridcraft
Modune:   https://github.com/harmony-contrib/craft-anything
Visrune:  https://github.com/harmony-contrib/artcraft

Each originates from its repository's feat-openharmony branch. The migrated
hosts and Ability registration are derived from the corresponding apps/<craft>
and apps/<craft>-ohos integration layers. The upstream engine and UI source are
not vendored in this project. Original copyrights and MIT OR Apache-2.0
licenses remain in effect; per-project license and attribution texts are in
licenses/<craft>. Exact revisions are recorded in Cargo.toml and Cargo.lock.
Upstream repositories retain their complete contributor and asset records.

@ohos-rs/ability and its plugins are MIT OR Apache-2.0.
The files plugin is consumed from a pinned Git commit in
https://github.com/harmony-contrib/openharmony-ability (plugins/files).
Its MIT and Apache-2.0 licenses are preserved in the dependency package.

Zaoyu, its application names and the replacement application icons identify this
independent adaptation. They do not imply endorsement by upstream authors.
Upstream ArtCraft marks are not licensed by the engine's software license.
